<div style="text-align: center;">
<p>It's hell.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br />
(But not actually)</p>
<blockquote>
<p>This is JAKSTYLE. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5588260); return false;"><img class="small" src="/o/7adaa6b5c5e34f9e433c42a796ddcc971a0b42627c1feba477b235a2805bcac8" alt="JakdragonX" style="background-image:url("/o/822614447ccae3c6c12a2ab911c861d3adbaa035b34a65550619e789e420e81f")" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5588260); return false;">JakdragonX</a></span>'s<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-1')">1</a></sup> personal ripoff of <a href="/theme:placestyle">PLACESTYLE</a>, <a href="/theme:blankstyle">BLANKSTYLE</a>, and just about every other style that you can think of. It isn't associated with any in-universe group, canon, GoI, or anything else (I'm not that fucking clever. Who do you think I am, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6479803); return false;"><img class="small" src="/o/849fb06c8c5a6f6329f7d1ee7059efa5e34c0ca87eea9739bf6a1256917a86b0" alt="HarryBlank" style="background-image:url("/o/822614447ccae3c6c12a2ab911c861d3adbaa035b34a65550619e789e420e81f")" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6479803); return false;">HarryBlank</a></span>?)<br />
Anyone is free to use this, but keep in mind that I can't even remember what I ate five minutes ago, so user discretion is advised should you decide that this is &quot;mega cool.&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<h1 id="toc1"><span>HOW TO USE?</span></h1>
<p>To import this theme, simply add this snippet of code above your page and pray that I haven't fucked something up that would cause it to not work properly.<br /></p>
<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p>[[include :scp-wiki:theme:black-highlighter-theme]]<br />
[[include :scp-wiki:theme:jakstyle]]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>To edit the header, subheader, and background image, please use the following code after including the above:</p>
</div>
<blockquote>
<p>[[module CSS]]<br />
:root {<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">--header-title:&#32;&quot;title&#32;here&quot;;</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">--header-subtitle:&#32;&quot;subtitle&#32;here&quot;;</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">--lgurl:&#32;url('your&#32;url&#32;here');</span><br />
}<br />
[[/module]]</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>NOTE:</strong> Please understand that this is a <strong>DARK</strong> theme. Attempting to edit this theme to use colors that are either really dark or immensely bright is probably going to hurt some eyes and hurt your total ratings (you'll thank me for this later.)</p>
<h1 id="toc2"><span>WHAT'S DIFFERENT?</span></h1>
<p>What are you, fucking blind? A lot's different. But, if you need a detailed list of things that I've changed, here you go:</p>
<ul>
<li>It's all black as shit.</li>
<li>It's all white as shit.</li>
<li>Somehow I decided that borders were <em>so</em> last decade.</li>
<li>Robbed <a href="/theme:penumbra">Penumbra</a> of its lunch money.</li>
<li>Added <a href="/component:toggle-sidebar-bhl">Toggle Sidebar</a> by default.</li>
<li>Decided that a <a href="/component:centered-header-bhl">Centered Header</a> was so, so much better.</li>
<li>Went to community service for desecrating <a href="/theme:extra-black-highlighter-theme">Extra Black Highlighter</a></li>
<li>Changed the look of hyperlinks and collapsibles.</li>
<li>Developed a fear of colors.</li>
<li>Returned <a href="/theme:penumbra">Penumbra</a>'s lunch money after having a change of heart</li>
<li>Changed the way that some components look, like the <a href="/component:info-ayers">Ayers Info Module</a> and <a href="/component:anomaly-class-bar">ACS</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>If you're still wanting to see more, this next section will give you some examples of ordinary Wikidot formatting.</p>
